---
import AccountLayout from "../layouts/AccountLayout.astro";import "../styles/workspace-tools.css";
---
<AccountLayout title="SKU Manager" current="skus"><header class="portal-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">Internal product identity</div><h1>SKU Manager</h1><p>Reserve unique internal SKUs and connect them to your saved products.</p></div><a class="button button-secondary" href="/catalogue/">Choose catalogue products</a></header><p id="sku-plan" class="workspace-plan">Loading plan…</p><a id="sku-upgrade" href="/pricing/" class="button button-secondary" hidden>Compare plans with SKU Manager</a><p id="sku-status" class="workspace-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="workspace-grid"><section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Generate unique SKUs</h2><form id="sku-generate"><fieldset id="sku-generate-fields" disabled><div class="workspace-form"><label>Prefix<input id="sku-prefix" value="SKU" pattern="[A-Z0-9_-]*" maxlength="20" /></label><label>Category code<input id="sku-category-code" pattern="[A-Z0-9_-]*" maxlength="20" placeholder="e.g. PHN" /></label><label class="wide">Numbering pattern<input id="sku-pattern" value="{prefix}-{number:06}" maxlength="100" required /><small>Tokens: {"{prefix}"}, {"{category}"}, {"{number:06}"}. Example: ELEC-PHN-000123.</small></label><label>Start for a new sequence<input id="sku-start" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="999999999" required /><small>Existing sequences continue from their next unused value.</small></label><label>Quantity<input id="sku-quantity" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" required /></label><p id="sku-selection" class="wide">No products selected. Generated SKUs will be reserved for later association.</p><div class="wide workspace-actions"><button class="button button-signal" type="submit">Generate SKUs</button><button id="sku-detach" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Clear product selection</button></div></div></fieldset></form><pre id="sku-generated" class="workspace-output" hidden></pre><p class="portal-note">Internal SKUs are not officially registered GS1 GTINs. Reserved codes are never automatically reused.</p></section><section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Import or export the register</h2><form id="sku-import"><label class="workspace-field">CSV or XLSX file<input id="sku-file" type="file" accept=".csv,.xlsx" required /></label><p>Columns: code (or sku), optional product_id and category. Formulas, external links and macros are rejected. Existing allocations are kept.</p><button class="button button-secondary" type="submit">Import SKUs</button></form><div class="workspace-actions"><button id="sku-import-report" class="button button-secondary" type="button" hidden>Download import report</button>{["csv","xlsx","json"].map(format=><button type="button" class="button button-secondary" data-sku-export={format}>Export {format.toUpperCase()}</button>)}</div><p>Imports use processing-row allowance; generated SKUs use their separate monthly generation allowance.</p></section></div><section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Allocated SKUs</h2><form id="sku-search" class="workspace-form"><label>Search code<input id="sku-query" type="search" maxlength="100" /></label><label>Category<input id="sku-filter-category" maxlength="100" /></label><label>Sort<select id="sku-sort"><option value="newest">Newest first</option><option value="code">Code</option></select></label><button type="submit" class="button button-secondary">Search</button></form><div class="workspace-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="SKU register"><table class="workspace-table"><thead><tr><th>SKU</th><th>Category</th><th>Association</th><th>Barcode</th></tr></thead><tbody id="sku-rows"></tbody></table></div><div class="workspace-actions"><button id="sku-prev" type="button" class="button button-secondary">Previous</button><span id="sku-page"></span><button id="sku-next" type="button" class="button button-secondary">Next</button></div><section id="sku-association" hidden><h3>Associate a reserved SKU</h3><form id="sku-associate-form" class="workspace-form"><label>Find a saved product<input id="sku-product-search" type="search" maxlength="100" /></label><button id="sku-find-products" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Find products</button><label class="wide">Product<select id="sku-product-choice"></select></label><button class="button button-signal" type="submit">Associate SKU</button></form><p>Only unassigned products are available. Existing assignments are never overwritten.</p></section></section></AccountLayout>
<script src="../scripts/sku-manager.ts"></script>
